        "lm8_q5h_5uy",
        "roi_rz4_ute"
      ],
      "reading": "太妃在策薨權初統事時問政，為孫堅吳夫人；襲答稱討逆明府是策，討虜是權。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-055-dongxi",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-055-dongxi"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-055-dongxi:line065:reading-000-059",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-055-dongxi:line065",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 59,
      "source_quote": "鄱陽賊彭虎等衆數萬人，襲與凌統、步隲、蔣欽各別分討。襲所向輒破，虎等望見旌旗，便散走，旬日盡平，拜威越校尉，遷偏將軍。",
      "person_id": "a2p_vdg_f3u",
      "related_person_ids": [
